======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 98 - Capacity Planning
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Guessing server sizes without quantitative mathematical derivation.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Mathematical capacity model linking DAU, QPS, latency, and resource saturation.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
